-------------------------------------------------------------------
Tue Nov 17 16:37:58 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to 0.5.0:
  * S3 and DynamoDB stores now use aiobotocore directly instead
    of aioboto3
  * Replace deprecated Redis SETEX writes, follow SCAN cursors
    when enumerating keys, and fix Valkey/Memcached TTL handling
  * Make lazy store setup safe across event loops; mark
    AsyncKeyValue as runtime checkable for Python 3.15
  * Preserve supplied caches and existing entries in local stores,
    and routing, values and TTL contracts in wrappers/adapters
  * Keep MultiDiskStore cache directories within the configured
    base; export ManagedEntry

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Mon Sep 21 08:34:02 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to 0.4.6:
  * Add FileTreeStore.cull() to reclaim the disk space of expired
    entries, which are otherwise only removed when something
    reads the key, and fix a get() race
  * Pass the username through in RedisStore
  * A key literally named "info" is no longer silently hidden
- Require aiofile >= 3.12.3, following upstream, and require
  typing_extensions: it is an unconditional dependency whose
  imports are unguarded, and nothing pulled it in on the Python
  flavours we build

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Fri Jun 19 06:15:18 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Initial package (version 0.4.5)
